# Praktika domain (invariants)

Authoritative detail: `docs/DECISIONS.md` (wins over `STAGE_0_APPROVED_LOGIC.md`).

## Cycle and occurrence

- Questions hold cycle positions **1–21**; calendar time lives on `QuestionOccurrence`
- Occurrence identity for product logic: **cycleNumber + cyclePosition** (persist `id` across pause re-anchor)
- Only **one** current answerable question; unanswered old questions must not accumulate as a queue
- When the next semantic question becomes due, an old `AVAILABLE` occurrence becomes `MISSED_BY_TIME`
- Statuses: `SCHEDULED` | `AVAILABLE` | `ANSWERED` | `SKIPPED_BY_USER` | `MISSED_BY_TIME` (no `CANCELLED`)
- `MISSED_BY_TIME` is persisted; not automatically user-visible in archive UI
- Deleting an answer does **not** reopen a completed occurrence

## Archive and notifications

- Archive is **answer-centric** (answers shown; skips not shown as archive entries)
- Room is source of truth for occurrence status; notification delivery time does not redefine status
- Notification planning is **single-current** (boundaries for the current incomplete occurrence)

## Terminology

- Developer/project: **backup / бекап**
- User-facing feature: **резервная копия / резервная папка**

